4006..4079 Comment "/// Scope extrusion beside garbage collection where `out` takes a channel"
4080..4156 Comment "/// (Milner, _Communicating and Mobile Systems: the π-Calculus_, CUP 1999)."
4157..4234 Comment "/// Collection rewrites the restriction extrusion matches, and the overlap is"
4235..4310 Comment "/// decided as a higher-order critical pair (Mayr and Nipkow, _Higher-order"
4311..4388 Comment "/// rewrite systems and their confluence_, TCS 1998), each variable a pattern"
4389..4466 Comment "/// over the channels it may name (Miller, _A logic programming language with"
4467..4539 Comment "/// lambda-abstraction, function variables, and simple unification_, JLC"
4540..4617 Comment "/// 1991): extrusion\'s `p` may name the restriction\'s channel and its `q` may"
4618..4691 Comment "/// not, collection\'s `p` may not. Composed, the peak restricts a channel"
4692..4764 Comment "/// neither process names, and both rewrites reach the two side by side."
4765..4767 Other "@["
